WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.007 --> 00:00:10.617
Excel layout — A faithful replica of Key Artifact Generator-V1.0.xls: the Data Sheet, sheet tabs, macros as buttons and sheet protection.

2
00:00:10.617 --> 00:00:16.052
The Data Sheet, exactly like the workbook — jump to a section from the left panel.

3
00:00:16.052 --> 00:00:20.461
Project-Data → Risks (the workbook’s GoToDataSection macro).

4
00:00:20.461 --> 00:00:24.730
Sheet tabs are the generated artifacts — the Kick-Off deck…

5
00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:28.850
…the Application Initiation Note, renamed per project…

6
00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:32.326
…and every Internal Project Plan section.

7
00:00:32.326 --> 00:00:40.397
WBS For JIRA — generated from the HR plan and task templates (the GenWBS2 macro).

8
00:00:40.397 --> 00:00:45.811
Protect / Unprotect toggles read-only mode, like the sheet-protection radios.

9
00:00:45.811 --> 00:00:51.184
Copy To Desktop downloads the chosen artifact as an Excel file.
